Subject: [PATCH] Campaign emails: bold, italic, underline and bullet points

The Message box on Campaigns gets a toolbar (B, I, U, bullet list) and
Ctrl/Cmd+B, I, U. The text stays plain: **bold**, *italic*, ++underline++
and "- " lines become formatting when the email is built, so existing
campaigns and merge variables are unaffected. A live preview shows the
result, and the campaign history shows the formatted message. Branded
emails (campaigns, invitations, reminders) share the same renderer.

